  "contentHtml": "<p><span>225개의 고정카메라(트랩 카메라)에서 자동으로 수집된 이미지를 사용하여 탄자니아의 세렝게티 국립공원에서 동물을 분류하는 시민과학 프로젝트 입니다.</span></p><p><span>목적은 종들이 어떻게 자연적인 상황에서 어떻게 분포하고 서로 상호작용하는지 연구하는 것입니다.</span></p><p>생명다양성 탐구에 활용할 수 있을 것 같습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.zooniverse.org/projects/zooniverse/snapshot-serengeti\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.zooniverse.org/projects/zooniverse/snapshot-serengeti</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Zooniverse\" data-og-description=\"The Zooniverse is the world’s largest and most popular platform for people-powered research.\" data-og-host=\"www.zooniverse.org\" data-og-source-url=\"https://www.zooniverse.org/projects/zooniverse/snapshot-serengeti\" data-og-url=\"https://www.zooniverse.org/projects/zooniverse/snapshot-serengeti\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/FFLbZ/hyM3NlHhRv/0C2M0FQ2Cul5fJuWeWrQ41/img.png?width=1200&amp;height=1200&amp;face=0_0_1200_1200,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/Ucind/hyM4zMULHr/P2nRBAdWG4GkwxSemG7zAK/img.png?width=1200&amp;height=1200&amp;face=0_0_1200_1200\"><a href=\"https://www.zooniverse.org/projects/zooniverse/snapshot-serengeti\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://www.zooniverse.org/projects/zooniverse/snapshot-serengeti\"><div class=\"og-image\" style=\"background-image:url(https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/FFLbZ/hyM3NlHhRv/0C2M0FQ2Cul5fJuWeWrQ41/img.png?width=1200&amp;height=1200&amp;face=0_0_1200_1200,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/Ucind/hyM4zMULHr/P2nRBAdWG4GkwxSemG7zAK/img.png?width=1200&amp;height=1200&amp;face=0_0_1200_1200)\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Zooniverse</p><p class=\"og-desc\">The Zooniverse is the world’s largest and most popular platform for people-powered research.</p><p class=\"og-host\">www.zooniverse.org</p></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/17731eebf6ed6fac80d433d443c0f9c8b9022176\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/17731eebf6ed6fac80d433d443c0f9c8b9022176\" data-origin-width=\"1707\" data-origin-height=\"1067\"></div><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
